# Jalankan dulu: node test-extension/status-server.js   (server lokal, port 8099)

### 404 body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/404

###

### 401 body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/401

###

### 403 body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/403

###

### 429 body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/429

###

### 500 body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/500

###

### 503 body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/503

###

### 599 kode tak dikenal, body kosong
GET http://localhost:8099/status/599

###

### 204 sukses tanpa body
GET http://localhost:8099/status/204

###

### 304 not modified
GET http://localhost:8099/status/304

###

### 418 teks singkat (kartu + kutipan body)
GET http://localhost:8099/text/418

###

### 500 teks singkat (kartu + kutipan body)
GET http://localhost:8099/text/500

###

### 404 teks multi-baris (body biasa, bukan kartu)
GET http://localhost:8099/multi/404

###

### 400 JSON (body biasa, bukan kartu)
GET http://localhost:8099/json/400

###

### 200 JSON (body biasa)
GET http://localhost:8099/json/200

###

### Error jaringan (Request failed)
GET https://tidak-ada-host.invalid

###

### Cancelled: kirim lalu tekan Cancel / Escape
GET http://localhost:8099/delay/10
